  #|["markdown","对比了三种做法，结果如下：\n\n| 做法 | 首帧耗时 | 内存 | 结论 |\n|:--|--:|--:|:-:|\n| 全量重排 | 4.2 ms | 18 MB | 太慢 |\n| 按行缓存 | 1.1 ms | 22 MB | 可以 |\n| 只排可见的行，其余按估计高度占位 | 0.6 ms | 12 MB | 采用 |\n\n```ts\nexport function placeRows(rows: Row[], from: number): number {\n  const visible = rows.filter((r) => r.top >= from && r.top < from + window.innerHeight * 2) // 只排屏幕附近的行\n  return visible.length\n}\n```\n\n```sh\npnpm test --filter list -- --reporter dot\n```",[["p",[[0,13]]],["table",[["tr",[["th",[[17,19]]],["th",[[22,26]]],["th",[[29,31]]],["th",[[34,36]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[59,63]]],["td",[[66,72]]],["td",[[75,80]]],["td",[[83,85]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[90,94]]],["td",[[97,103]]],["td",[[106,111]]],["td",[[114,116]]]]],["tr",[["td",[[121,137]]],["td",[[140,146]]],["td",[[149,154]]],["td",[[157,159]]]]]],{"align":["left","right","right","center"],"md":"| 做法 | 首帧耗时 | 内存 | 结论 |\n| :-- | --: | --: | :-: |\n| 全量重排 | 4.2 ms | 18 MB | 太慢 |\n| 按行缓存 | 1.1 ms | 22 MB | 可以 |\n| 只排可见的行，其余按估计高度占位 | 0.6 ms | 12 MB | 采用 |","csv":"做法,首帧耗时,内存,结论\n全量重排,4.2 ms,18 MB,太慢\n按行缓存,1.1 ms,22 MB,可以\n只排可见的行，其余按估计高度占位,0.6 ms,12 MB,采用"}],["pre",{"code":[169,362],"lang":"ts","ink":"g7h9i9cj4c2l3c4g4c2l6c3l7c4h6j8c2j4ci6c2jc5jcj4h3g5h3jcj4h2g5h2j6cj12h2fc2b14g7j7cj7c"}],["pre",{"code":[374,415],"lang":"sh","ink":"i5d5k9d5k14d3"}]]]
