  #|["code.ink","ts\u0001// 列表的行按真实高度排，没量过的先按估计的高度占位\nexport function moved(rows: number[], at: number, n: number): number[] {\n  const out = rows.slice(0, at);\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) out.push(-1);\n  return out.concat(rows.slice(at));\n}\n\nexport const estimate = 66;","b28g7h9i5cj4c2l6c4j2c2l6c2jc2l6c3l6c7h6j4c2j4ci5cfc2j2c5g4ch4j2c2fc2j2h2jc2jh2c2j3ci4chfc5g7j3ci6cj4ci5cj2c7g7h6j9c2f2c"]
  #|["reader.book","md\u0001# 发布前要做的\n\n- 版本号和更新说明\n- 安卓和 mac 的包都签名\n- 截图换成**新的**\n\n> 第二屏的插画再小一点。\n\n`scripts/shots.sh` 会把新截图和旧的比一遍。",{"answer":{"length":97,"wrapped":0,"joined":false,"chapters":[{"title":"发布前要做的","offset":0}],"heads":[],"md":[["h",[[2,8]],{"depth":1}],["list",[["li",[[12,20]]],["li",[[23,36]]],["li",[[39,43],["b",[[45,47]]]]]]],["quote",[["p",[[53,64]]]]],["p",[["code",{"content":[67,83],"path":[67,83]}],[84,97]]]]},"search":{}}]
  #|["reader.book","md\u0001# 发布清单\n\n这份清单在每次发布前过一遍，**每一项**都要有人确认。\n\n## 准备\n\n- 版本号已经改好\n- 更新说明写完，交给 *两个人* 读过\n- 截图换成新的\n\n## 检查\n\n1. 在手机上装一遍，从头点到尾\n2. 看一眼 `release.log` 里有没有报错\n3. 旧版本升级上来，草稿还在\n\n> 有一项不确定，就先不发。\n\n---\n\n最后更新：十月中旬。\n",{"answer":{"length":187,"wrapped":0,"joined":false,"chapters":[{"title":"发布清单","offset":0},{"title":"准备","offset":38},{"title":"检查","offset":86}],"heads":[],"md":[["h",[[2,6]],{"depth":1}],["p",[[8,22],["b",[[24,27]]],[29,36]]],["h",[[41,43]],{"depth":2}],["list",[["li",[[47,54]]],["li",[[57,67],["i",[[68,71]]],[72,75]]],["li",[[78,84]]]]],["h",[[89,91]],{"depth":2}],["list",[["li",[[96,109]]],["li",[[113,117],["code",{"content":[118,129],"path":[118,129]}],[130,137]]],["li",[[141,153]]]],{"ordered":true}],["quote",[["p",[[157,169]]]]],["hr"],["p",[[176,186]]]]},"search":{"每一项":[24]}}]
